# Separators and generators

Extensions of Mathlib's separators and generators of a category.

## Main definitions

None: this umbrella re-exports its children.

## Main results

None; this module re-exports its children, among them
`CategoryTheory.IsSeparator.exists_subobject_epi_of_epi`, the lifting of an epimorphism
of an abelian category along a separator (Stacks, Tag 079J).

## Implementation notes

The children follow the files of Mathlib's `Mathlib/CategoryTheory/Generator/`.

